sentences.text:
In view of the findings on Issue no.1, the petitioner/s are granted the following reliefs: -
i) fair market value @ 11,41,466/- per acre for Category A land and @
Rs.11,12,929.35/- per acre for category B land for the acquired land, whichever is applicable, as per statement u/s 19 of the LA Act;
ii) additional amount @ 12% per annum on the fair market value u/s 23 (1A) of the LA Act , from the date SIDHARTH MATHUR MATHUR Date: 2026.02.05 15:06:07 Ved Prakash (10/99-2000) vs Union Of India (Sannoth) on 5 February, 2026 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/151367663/
4 +0530 of notification u/s 4 of the LA Act till the date of award or dispossession,
whichever is earlier ;
iii) solatium u/s 23 (2) of LA Act @ 30% on the enhanced amount of compensation ;
iv) interest under Section 28 of L.A Act @ 9% per annum for the first year from the date of dispossession and at the rate of 15% per annum on the difference between the enhanced compensation awarded by this court and the compensation awarded by the LAC for the subsequent period till its payment ;
20.

